    "Accountability: Each member is responsible for their assigned section. If a member anticipates missing a deadline, they must notify the team at least 48 hours in advance so tasks can be redistributed. (Getting carpet bomb)\n",
    "Policy Agreement: By submitting this proposal, we confirm that we have read the COGS 108 Team Policies and agree to adhere to the expectations outlined above.\n",
    "\n"
 "##PROJECT TIMELINE PROPOSAL\n",
"Week 1-2: Finalize proposal and secure the PCPartPicker pricing dataset.\n",
"Week 3 (Checkpoint #1): Clean the data (standardize "Price per GB" across different kit sizes).\n",
"Week 4 (Checkpoint #2): EDA. Visualizing the price trends of RAM alongside NVDA stock price over time.\n",
"Week 5-7: Statistical Analysis. Perform correlation analysis and potentially a linear regression to see if "AI Date" is a significant predictor of "RAM Price."\n",
"Week 8: Draft Final Report and record Video.\n",
"Week 10: Final submission.\n",
